window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>They call me an outcast, weak.</b></p> <p>I’ve fought my whole life for survival, running from an attack on my family I ended up hiding with the Ash Wolves. This one move might be my biggest mistake of all. And I’m the queen of mistakes....</p> <p>I let them believe I’m broken, let them believe the lies. I let them believe anything they want...as long as it isn’t the truth.</p> <p>There's a monster inside me, one made of teeth and claws and terrifying need. I swallow it down, hiding under the pretense of being normal. But I'm not normal. I'm anything but.</p> <p>Bonding is the only thing that will save us - me and the Ash pack. Only I need someone strong enough to fight the darkness inside me...and savage enough to stay.</p> <p>Will the three ruthless alphas help me...when they find out the truth of what I am? </p> <p><b>This is book oone in a shifter paranormal romance story for those who love strong protectors, wolf shifters, and steamy scenes.</b></p>"; 
